  "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
  "about": "Dispensary bay modelled as a generic product: uprights, back panel, plinth, canopy with bay label, base shelf and 7 inclined shelves with clear lips and label rails, blue and yellow dispensing bins and boxed stock (Fine). Geometry is drawn at the 900_Dispensary type; the other types share it until a parametric pass. Reference: query: casework pharmacy shelving dispensary casework hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=casework+pharmacy+shelving+dispensary+casework+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
